+            f"`{comparisons['transport_classification_only']['conflict']['paired_bootstrap_95_ci']}` "
+            "| Oracle diagnostic after lock |"
+        ),
+        "",
+        "## Isolated mechanism",
+        "",
+        "The candidate exactly isolates the public VSFOT `loss_align`: a CLIP",
